  itemName: Stormfang -Blade of the Skyfire
  itemIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ade2a5326f0ce9344adfef56208a7071, type: 3}
  itemDescription: "A relic of an ancient war between gods of the sky, Stormfang
    crackles with unrestrained lightning, arcing from one blade to the other like
    a thunderstorm trapped in steel. The twin edges conduct raw storm energy, making
    each strike fast, precise, and electrifying. Wielders report hearing whispers
    of thunder during combat \u2014 echoes of forgotten tempests."
